# --- Large derived analytic intermediate (>100 MB, regenerable) -----------------
# qci_complete_data.csv is the merged GBD long-form dataset with the three
# component ratios joined per location-year-sex-age. It is produced from
# data/ihme.csv via code/notebooks/2.cleaning_data.ipynb and
# 3.pca_analysis.ipynb. Excluded from the repository because it exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit; users who want to re-run analyses that
# depend on it should regenerate it locally (see README).
